Package: oncoRsubmissionLab
Title: Oncology R Submission Lab
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Learner", "Maintainer", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Educational Shiny application for learning how oncology FDA
    study-data packages (SDTM, ADaM, TLFs, reviewer's guides, eCTD Module 5)
    are assembled in R, as the counterpart of a SAS programming workflow.
    Not a regulatory submission and not validated software.
